{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"We can play around with the expressions in the answer choices to see if they are the same as $4m-2+(-8m)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"Let's see if the first expression is equivalent to $4m-2+(-8m)$.\n\n$\\qquad\n\\begin{align}\n\\\\\\\\\n{-2(4m+1) +4m}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} 4m-2+(-8m)  \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{-2(4m+1) +4m}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} -4m-2  \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{(-2)4m+(-2)1 +4m}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} -4m-2  \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{-8m+(-2) +4m}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} -4m-2  \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{-4m-2}   \u0026= -4m-2 \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n \\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"Let's see if the second expression is equivalent to $4m-2+(-8m)$.\n\n$\\qquad\n\\begin{align}\n\\\\\\\\\n{2(2m-1)-8m}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} 4m-2+(-8m)  \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{2(2m-1)-8m}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=}  -4m-2    \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{(2)2m-(2)1-8m}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=}  -4m-2  \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{4m-2-8m}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=}  -4m-2  \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{-4m-2}   \u0026= -4m-2  \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n \\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"The following expressions are equivalent to $4m-2+(-8m)$ :\n\n\n-  ${-2(4m+1) +4m} $\n\n-  ${2(2m-1)-8m} $","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**Which expressions are equivalent to $4m-2+(-8m)$ ?**  \n\n[[☃ radio 1]]\n\n","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"content":"$-2(4m+1) +4m$","correct":true},{"content":"$2(2m-1)-8m$","correct":true},{"isNoneOfTheAbove":true}],"countChoices":false,"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":true,"multipleSelect":true,"randomize":false},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
